    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlamya bo shiikolile mu hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lūshikūū lwa katanò ng'weji gwa katandatū, ng'waka gwa katandatū, naalī nigashije mu numba yane, na a banamhala ba Yuda baalī bigashije hamò nū nene, ū nkono go ng'wa Seeba MULUNGU gūnizīīla a henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho naalola nūbona gītī munhū, ū kwandīja aho yalī gītī ha nkīmbīlī gwakwe kwika sīlīlī, waali gītī moto; ū kwandīja a henaho kūja igūlya, gītī chūma shiteemagīzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgoloola gītī nkono, ūnidimīla kū nzwīlī jane; hūna ū Moyo ūnibūūcha higūlya, ūnitwala Yelusalemu nalī mu koolekegeje ka ng'wa Mulungu. Ūnishikīja ha wingīlīlo wa mita gwa sukuma gwa ng'wibīndo lya mu gatī, shiikolile sh'ipelanya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sh'ipelanya:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, īsho shikenhelejaga wilu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " shaalī shikīndīkilwe henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha būtongi wane lyalīho ī likūjo lya ng'wa Mulungu wa Isilaeli gītī īlo naalī nalībona mu shakoolechiwa aho nalī kū mbūga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūniwīla, “Ng'wana wa munhū, alilolaga ī sukuma.” Nūlola ko, a ha wingīlīlo ī sukuma ya mita gwa kūja ha ng'walīlò, nūshibona ī shiikolile sh'ipelanya shenīshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūniwīla, “Ng'wana wa munhū ūlīyībona īyo balīta, ī y'ipelanya īyo banhū ba numba ya Isilaeli bakwīyītaga a henaha, īyo īkūnipeejaga nīnge naje kūle nī lipandī lyane lyeela? Alīyo ūkūbona yīngī y'ipelanya kūkīla a henaho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūnenha a ha kwingīlīla ng'wibīndo. Aho nalola gwalīho ng'obo ha ndugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūniwīla, “Ng'wana wa munhū, alisīmbaga a ha ndugu henaho.” Nūsīmba ng'hana a ha ndugu, nūbona ho nyango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūniwīla, “Ingīlaga mo ūkīībone ī yabūbi na y'ipelanya īyo bakwīyītaga ū ng'wenūmu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningīla mo, aho naalola nūbona shiinū ja malofu ja būlī mbika joolilwe a ha ndugu pyī ī jose, shiinū ja kwigwesa hasī, na ja kūshimīza, na būlī mbika ya shiikolile īsho banhū ba numba ya Isilaeli bashilamyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banamhala makūmi mpungatī ba Isilaeli baalī bīmīīla a ha būtongi wa shose shenīshi; nū Yazania ng'witūnja o ng'wa Shafani walī īmīīlile hamò nabo. Būlī ūmò wabo ū mu nkono walī na shinje ya shitambò sha kūzuukīja; lyochi lya ng'waso gwawiza lyadundumūkaga kūj'igūlya gītī ilunde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūniwīla, “Ng'wana wa munhū wībona īyo bakīyītaga a banamhala ba numba ya Isilaeli ū mu giiti, būlī ng'wene mu chumba sha shiikolile shakwe sha kūlamiwa? Bakiwīlaga gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA atūtūbona, ū SEEBA wīgumanīja ī sī.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya hangī, “Ūkūbabona balīta na mihayo y'ipelanya kūheeba ī yenīyī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūnitwala kū wingīlīlo wa kū mita gwa sukuma ya numba ya ng'wa SEEBA, nūsanga koi bakīma bigashaga bakūnīlaga Tamuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūniwīla, “Bebe ng'wana wa munhū, ūlīgūbona ū gwenūyū? Ūkūbona mihayo y'ipelanya kūheeba a ha yenīyī.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūnenha mu ng'wibīndo lya mu gatī ya numba ya ng'wa SEEBA, a ha kwingīlīla mu hekalu, a ha gatī y'ibīndo lya hanze na ng'walīlò, baalīho bagosha gītī makūmi abīlī na batanò. Ī numba ya ng'wa SEEBA baalī bīyinhīla migongo; ū būshū wabo babūlogegije kīya, bakūlīlamyaga līīmi ī kīya kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūniwīla, “Wagūbona ū gwenūyū ng'wana wa munhū? Gūlī ndo ū mhayo gwa numba ya Isilaeli kwīta ī y'ipelanya īyo bakwīyīta ū ng'wenūmu? Nibūlī nī sī bīyokaje wiboneeji, na kūmanūnipelanya dūhū? Alibalolage ūmo bakwitūūlīlaga itambī kū mūūlū gabo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, nakūbīītīla ya kūbīītīla, nguno baanipelanije no; Ī liso lyane lītūbachīla shigongo, nūūlū natūbasaatwa na hado yaya; h'ūmo batandūkīle bakūnilīlīīlaga mu matū, natūbigwa nūūlū hado.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
